  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2102.28 Record Keeping for Agriculture Water Use",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2102.28 Record Keeping for Agriculture Water Use. Each agriculture water user shall maintain an accurate record of water use, including all direct measurements and calculations, for 3 years.\n\nSource. #9279, eff 9-24-08; ss by #12135, eff 3-21-17 (from Env-Wq 2102.27)",
